{
 "where": "Pittsburgh",
 "clock": "7:00 pm",
 "evidence_now": [
  "Tuesday, February 2, 2016, 7:00 pm.",
  "You are in Pittsburgh. At the bus terminal there is a payphone and a bench.",
  "Today the station has one seven o'clock bulletin. The producer can run the portable switcher from anywhere. The reporter has a phone return; the cameraman has a return for footage he has captured. The station plays its ident if nobody takes the switcher."
 ],
 "people_in_earshot": [],
 "remembered_experiences": [
  {
   "morning_observation": "Tuesday, February 2, 2016. The local radio plays three bright notes and announces a groundhog forecast in the town square. A delivery van backfires twice.",
   "episodes_in_order": [
    "6:00 am in inn: Phil spends the period at the inn. Rita says: Morning, Phil. I'm going to stay here for a bit to sort out the switcher setup and see if we can get that band on the afternoon slot. You grab a coffee and let me know if the forecast data is ready to go. Rita spends the period at the inn.",
    "9:30 am in inn: Phil spends the period at the inn. Rita says: Morning, Phil. Give me a few minutes to get my voice up before we roll. I don't want to sound like I'm still in a deep sleep on air. I'm going to stay here for now to finalize the rundown and coffee order. Rita spends the period at the inn.",
    "1:00 pm in inn: Phil uses the paid ticket and rides the coach all the way to Pittsburgh. Rita says: Larry, get your camera set up at the square for the band segment. I'm moving over now to lock down the switcher feed. Rita leaves the inn."
   ]
  },
  {
   "most_recent_own_plan": "Head to Pittsburgh to prepare for the Wednesday couch move."
  }
 ],
 "available_actions": {
  "call_live_report": "Dial the station and deliver your live report from your current location.",
  "look_around": "Inspect your present surroundings.",
  "call_sister": "Telephone your sister in Pittsburgh about tomorrow's move.",
  "spend_time_here": "Stay where you are for the period."
 },
